n Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T07:13:35-07:00","id":1387704,"title":"","content":"I think OPP waits to put the PDF up for sale after backers get their physical copies. At least, that appears to be what they're doing for They Came From Beneath the Sea! So I would expect it to take a bit longer than 2 months.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T07:15:02-07:00","id":1387706,"title":"","content":"So far the only rules changes I see are Carapace (now stacks with armour), Angry Rhino Charge (simplified), and Mountainous Spirit Expression (buffed).<br /> <br /> If anyone sees more, do mention them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T07:23:41-07:00","id":1387710,"title":"","content":"There's a new charm for buffing HBT.<br /> <br /> There's a new place near Mahalanka.<br /> <br /> Last Warrior's Unity is nerfed in tiny or miniscule forms.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T07:26:44-07:00","id":1387713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1387676-fangs-at-the-gate-out-later-today-to-backers?p=1387704#post1387704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think OPP waits to put the PDF up for sale after backers get their physical copies. At least, that appears to be what they're doing for They Came From Beneath the Sea! So I would expect it to take a bit longer than 2 months.</div> </div> </div> </div>Crap, didn't know that. Thanks, I'll delete my wildly optimistic guess \u2013 don't want to get people's hopes up unfairly...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24647-moss-reynholm","name":"Moss Reynholm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24647_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T07:32:48-07:00","id":1387715,"title":"","content":"There's a new Shahan-Ya, a merchant prince of the south who destroys Satrapy's economies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T07:40:31-07:00","id":1387717,"title":"","content":"Relentless Lunar Fury now costs 5m, not 3m, 1wp.<br /> <br /> Halting the Scarlet Flow has an out-of-combat clause.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T07:49:37-07:00","id":1387720,"title":"","content":"That cover is seriously cool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T07:59:55-07:00","id":1387722,"title":"","content":"Invincible Beast-Warrior Empowerment has been made cheaper and doesn't end if you get crashed, but it also no longer applies to dice added by command actions so I'd call it a nerf overall.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12165-speedbump","name":"Speedbump","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T07:59:59-07:00","id":1387723,"title":"","content":"Mountainous Spirit Expression buffed! Yay!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mountainous Spirit Expression, p.266</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">She also gains the following benefits in addition to<br /> Legendary Size:<br /> \u2022 Her natural attacks deal +3 raw withering damage and add +3 Overwhelming.<br /> \u2022 She gains +3 natural soak and Hardness 7.<br /> \u2022 She adds +5 to her shape\u2019s effective Strength rating for determining what feats of strength she<br /> can attempt</div> </div> </div> </div>+3 OVW and Hardness 7 make a good difference I think. And boosting feats of strength just makes sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T08:01:15-07:00","id":1387724,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Speedbump</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1387676-fangs-at-the-gate-out-later-today-to-backers?p=1387722#post1387722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Invincible Beast-Warrior Empowerment has been made cheaper and doesn't end if you get crashed, but it also no longer applies to dice added by command actions so I'd call it a nerf overall.</div> </div> </div> </div>the devs said they wanted to rein it in a bit, it was just, well, broken in the manuscript.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T08:15:21-07:00","id":1387725,"title":"","content":"There's a new Solar Mate charm in Perception, for finding them (but not the first time).<br /> <br /> Ox-Body has been altered: less -1s, more -2s.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T08:24:01-07:00","id":1387727,"title":"","content":"Some war charms have been nerfed a bit.<br /> <br /> Fickle Lady's Shifting Star is changed a bit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T08:50:33-07:00","id":1387732,"title":"","content":"They made Solar Bond mutual (for most meetings). P134<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> SOLARS AND THE BOND<br /> Most Solars that encounter their Lunar mates experience<br /> a similar recognition and emotional connection,<br /> using the same rules as Lunars. That not<br /> all Solars do is a testament to the Lunar\u2019s greater<br /> capacity to change their nature. The same is true<br /> for Abyssals and Infernals, although they have a<br /> tendency toward negative Ties on first meeting<br /> their mates. A player may always opt not to reciprocate<br /> the bond if her Lunar mate is a Storyteller<br /> character. If she\u2019s a player character, the two players<br /> should discuss whether they\u2019re interested in a<br /> narrative of unreciprocated feelings beforehand. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T08:52:59-07:00","id":1387733,"title":"","content":"*looks at massive pile of work*<br /> *looks at new Lunars PDF*<br /> *internal screaming intensifies*<br /> <br /> The katana on the cover is like a dumb '90s timewarp and I love it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T08:54:21-07:00","id":1387734,"title":"","content":"Hypermobility is 2 merit dots, not 4.<br /> Glance-Oration Technique is 3m.<br /> I think there's a new INT&gt;Knowledge Charm that enhances fact introductions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T09:03:03-07:00","id":1387735,"title":"","content":"Ooh Striking Mospid Method in Dex got a buff. Its now &quot;Higher of 3 or Essence&quot; rerolls instead of Essence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T09:07:16-07:00","id":1387736,"title":"","content":"The character sheet for Lunars lacks check boxes to mark your favored and caste attributes and has check boxes for marking favored or caste abilities, which are not relevant for Lunars. I think that this is a pretty important thing to fix because it\u2019s a significant difference between Lunars and the Solars or Dragonblooded.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24935-werlynn","name":"werlynn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T09:16:49-07:00","id":1387738,"title":"","content":"Many-Voiced Mockingbird Attitude now clarrifies that it may be used even in shapes not capable of human speech. <br /> <br /> It is also now Totemic (Charisma) for spirit shapes that can mimic human speech or other animal noises --- which should also apply to the attribute 4 repurchase that allows you to speak in any valid voice (including your own) for a full scene for just one mote.<br /> <br /> ----<br /> <br /> There is also the Talking Animals sidebar which grants that Sacred Hunt charms limited to gaining human forms may also be used to obtain the forms of animals with human level intellect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":487,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","user":"Greyman","date":". 05-12-2020, 12:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T09:20:02-07:00","id":1387740,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>werlynn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1387676-fangs-at-the-gate-out-later-today-to-backers?p=1387736#post1387736\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The character sheet for Lunars lacks check boxes to mark your favored and caste attributes and has check boxes for marking favored or caste abilities, which are not relevant for Lunars. I think that this is a pretty important thing to fix because it\u2019s a significant difference between Lunars and the Solars or Dragonblooded.</div> </div> </div> </div>Put it in the errata form.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T09:21:17-07:00","id":1387741,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfpYvL5fmS8TXE8TNAsOoDlpL976GiKwW8myxgVXJk